Z||000000||theogre||10-06-2000||11:23 PM||||I've been playing again. IE4+ users can now read Tunnel 6 of the ogre cave offline! (That's all the fiero stuff.) I don't know if netscape supports channels.<P>Go the test link in my <A HREF="http://home.sprynet.com/~theogre" TARGET=_blank>main cavern</A><P>When you click the link you will get a box to add to you favorites. Make sure the box next to "make available off line" is checked.<P>then go to the tool menu and syncronize. (It will take a few minutes to sync)<P><BR>NOTE!!!! To View offline.... If you are on a network (LAN) you may need to click "work offline" in the IE file menu. This is because of the way some networks are setup. Not an IE problem. (IE is trying to use your network to reach the live site.)||||reg||1
